wer.&nbsp;</strong><span data-teams=\"true\">The UPSSSC Pharmacist Revised Exam Date has issued on 26 May 2026 by UPSSSC.</span></p>\n<p><strong>Q.&nbsp;<span data-teams=\"true\">When will the UPSSSC Pharmacist Exam Date 2026 exam be held?</span><br>\n</strong><strong>Answer.</strong>&nbsp;<span data-teams=\"true\">The UPSSSC Pharmacist examination will be conducted on <strong>29 June 2026</strong>.</span></p>\n<p><strong>Q.&nbsp;<span data-teams=\"true\">Where can I check the UPSSSC Pharmacist Revised Exam Date 2026?</span><br>\n</strong><strong>Answer.&nbsp;</strong>You can check it on the official UPSSSC website.</p>\n<p><strong>Q.&nbsp;<span data-teams=\"true\">What should I search on the website to find the UPSSSC Pharmacist Revised Exam Date 2026?</span><br>\n</strong><strong>Answer.</strong>&nbsp;<span data-teams=\"true\">Look for&nbsp;<strong>“Revised Exam Date – UPSSSC Pharmacist Recruitment 2026”</strong>&nbsp;in the notifications list</span></p>\n<p><strong>Q.&nbsp;<span data-teams=\"true\">What details are required to download the Revised Exam Date?</span><br>\n</strong><strong>Answer.&nbsp;</strong><span data-teams=\"true\">Candidates need their&nbsp;<strong>Registration Number / Roll Number</strong>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<strong>Password / Captcha</strong> to download the Eligibility Result</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13pt;\"><strong>Q. What is UPPSC Official Website?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer. </strong>The Official Website of UPSSSC is https://upsssc.gov.in/</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n",
